 "section_summary": "This section contains educational directory and survey records compiled by the Civil Information and Education Section of General Headquarters, Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers (GHQ SCAP). It comprises the concluding pages of a survey report for Ishikawa Prefecture—listing private youth schools, kindergartens, miscellaneous schools, and institutions operated under ministries other than education, alongside a reference map of Central Honshu—followed by the initial portion of Special Report R-302-E-L-26-33 for Saga Prefecture dated September 25, 1948. The Saga Prefecture report provides an explanatory introduction on Japanese educational administration, extensive summary statistical tables of schools, enrollments, and teaching staff for 1946, and detailed roster tables covering national, prefectural, municipal, and town or village educational institutions.",
 "subfiles": [
  {
   "about": "Concluding portion of a SCAP survey report detailing private and ministerial educational institutions in Ishikawa Prefecture and presenting a reference map of Central Honshu.",
   "continues_previous": true,
